<title>AUSTRIA: Boehler-Uddeholm EPS down at 90 ATS/share.</title>
<headline>Boehler-Uddeholm EPS down at 90 ATS/share.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian high-grade steel maker Boehler-Uddeholm's earnings per share fell to 90 schillings in 1996 from 106 schillings a year earlier, the Association of Austrian Analysts said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Boehler-Uddeholm earlier said its 1997 net profit inched down to 1.00 billion schillings from 1.11 billion a year earlier. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
